  "notes": "HIGH CONFIDENCE — primary-tier (WITS/UN Comtrade). India world total 2024: USD 221.39M across ~113,241 MT, spread over roughly 120 destination markets — one of the best-diversified lines in the whole dataset. Critically, dehydrated onion is NOT subject to the fresh-onion Minimum Export Price regime that complicates HS 0703.10 pricing, and it is ~33x larger by value than fresh garlic exports. Markets are developed-economy food processors (USA, Brazil, Germany, Belgium, Netherlands, Spain). Good candidate for Spanish/Portuguese-language content given Brazil at #2 and Spain in the top 10. NOTE: this code is dried ONION only; dried garlic falls under 0712.90, which was not separately pulled."
